    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kelly Hudson Properties present this cosy 4 bed semi detached property to the\r\n market. Nestled on a c.0.14 hectare/ c.0.34 acre site, this home comes to the market in fair condition. It comprises of kitchen/dining room, sitting room, bathroom and 4 bedrooms. Extending to c.1117.50sqft / c.103.82 sqm, it offers  great potential to it new owner.\r\n\r\nProviding all the benefits of country living, this is a great location c. 6kms from Derrinturn, where a host of excellent amenities can be found. These include, shops, bar, church, primary school and sporting organisations.  The larger town of Edenderry is a little over 10kms. Viewing is highly recommended!\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION:\r\n\r\nHallway: Carpet\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining: Lino flooring, fully fitted kitchen, stainless steel sink, fridge, dishwasher, stove fire\r\n\r\nUtility: Lino flooring, washing machine, tumble dryer, chest freezer\r\n\r\nSitting Room: Coving, centre rose, fireplace, wooden floor\r\n\r\nBathroom / Wet Room:  Tiled from floor to ceiling, extractor fan, shower, WHB, WC\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: Carpet, curtains, blinds\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: Carpet, curtains, blinds\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: Carpet, curtains, blinds\r\n\r\nBedroom 4: Wooden floor, fitted wardrobe, curtains, blinds\r\n\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n\r\nHardwood hall door\r\nCarpets, curtains & light fittings included\r\nOil & Solid fuel fired central heating\r\nApprox c.73 years old\r\nApprox c.1117.5sqft/ c.103.82sqm   \r\nPVC double glazed window\r\nOutside Tap\r\nAmple car parking\r\nNot over looked\r\nGravel drive\r\nFuel Store\r\nMains water\r\nSeptic Tank\r\n\r\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\r\n\r\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is \r\ntaken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. \t\r\n\r\nLicence No:001492"
      },
